# Skills linked into ~/.claude/skills/, one name per line.
# `flow install` reads this file.
#
# Every Flow skill is named here, and this list has no exceptions. There is one
# author, who wants every skill reachable in every project.
#
# Every skill is also on by default, so a session is shown every description.
# A project that does not want one turns it off in its own
# .claude/settings.json, under `skillOverrides`. That file is the list of what
# is off there, and this one is the list of what exists.

